---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
const updated = "September 2026";
---
<Layout title="Disclaimer - GWill Finance" description="The limits of the financial information published on GWill Finance." crumb="Disclaimer">
<section class="legal-hero"><div class="hero-grain" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<div class="con legal-hero-inner">
<p class="crumbs"><a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, "")}/`}>Home</a> › Disclaimer</p>
<p class="legal-hero-label">Legal</p>
<h1 class="legal-hero-title"><span class="g">Disclaimer</span></h1>
<p class="legal-seal">Last reviewed — {updated} · v0.1.0</p>
</div>
</section>
<section class="legal-section"><div class="con legal-layout">
<nav class="legal-toc" aria-label="On this page">
<p class="legal-toc-label">On this page</p>
<ol class="legal-toc-list">
<li><a href="#not-advice">Not financial advice</a></li>
<li><a href="#accuracy">Accuracy and rates</a></li>
<li><a href="#calculators">Calculators</a></li>
<li><a href="#external-links">External links</a></li>
<li><a href="#liability">Liability</a></li>
</ol>
</nav>
<div class="legal-body">
<div class="legal-block" id="not-advice">
<h2>Not financial advice</h2>
<p>Everything on GWill Finance is general educational information about Nigerian personal finance. It is not personal financial advice, and it does not consider your income, obligations, or risk tolerance. Talk to a licensed professional before acting on anything you read here.</p>
</div>
<div class="legal-block" id="accuracy">
<h2>Accuracy and rates</h2>
<p>Exchange rates, fees, and app features change fast. Every guide carries the date it was last checked, and maintained figures (transfer fees, savings rates, parallel-market spreads) carry a visible verified stamp. Always confirm the current number with the provider before you move money.</p>
</div>
<div class="legal-block" id="calculators">
<h2>Calculators</h2>
<p>Money calculators land with Phase 2. Their estimates will illustrate scenarios, not predict outcomes — taxes, fees, and market moves mean real results differ from any projection shown on screen.</p>
</div>
<div class="legal-block" id="external-links">
<h2>External links</h2>
<p>Links to banks, fintech apps, and other publications are provided for convenience. We do not control those sites and are not responsible for their content, terms, or availability.</p>
</div>
<div class="legal-block" id="liability">
<h2>Liability</h2>
<p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, GWill Finance is not liable for any loss or damage arising from your use of, or reliance on, the information on this site.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div></section>
</Layout>
